<title>FINLAND: WSOY 8-MTH PROFIT RISES 16 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>WSOY 8-MTH PROFIT RISES 16 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to end-August, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items    99.5 vs 86.8</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	     6.3 vs 5.7</p>
<p> Net sales				   703.1 vs 706.2</p>
<p> Operating profit			   71.9 vs 59.0</p>
<p> Operating margin			  121.4 vs 112.7</p>
<p> Depreciation				 49.5 vs 53.7</p>
<p> Net financial income		     27.6 vs 26.8</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			 nil vs 1 gain</p>
<p> Net profit				   74.9 vs 68.7</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)     64.1 vs 58.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish publisher is Werner Soderstrom</p>
<p>Osakeyhtio.</p>
